{
 "name": "ToonBodyV2_TransDSNoSkinRampOneRampHue2S",
 "entry": "WuwaToonBodyV2TransDSNoSkinRampOneRampHue2SBasePass",
 "include": "/Plugin/WuwaToon/Private/WuwaToonBasePass_V2Body.ush",
 "resolve": false,
 "kuro_shading_model": "MSM_ToonCommon (forward BLEND_Translucent base pass)",
 "kuro_asm": "M_CharV2_Com forward-translucent body PS 78f4974f (#106068, 820 instr; BLEND_Translucent). Material part (L64-626): the V2 body graph with UseDoubleSpecular, UseVDLShadowoffset, TwoSided, UseFresnel, UseHueShift, UseBlendParameter, one ramp row, no UseOnlySkinRampColor (WuwaToonBodyV2BasePass_Impl, RawOut 1) + UseTranslucent opacity max(min(E_Link gate, max(lum(max(spec, 0)), TypeMask.r * OpacityIntensity)), 0) (L505-543). Engine tail (not ported): primitive fade (L544-547), volumetric / vertex fog (L548-569), emissive scale + OOB (L570-591), screen shadow mask / CSM (L628-701), Kuro forward toon lighting of the main light (L702-777) and of the local-light list b4 (L778-876), pre-exposure (L878). Textures: Normal_Roughness_Metallic t4, TypeMask t5, RegionIDTex t6, MainTex t7, MatCapTex t8, Ramp t9 (t0 shadow depth, t1 fog volume, t2 pre-exposure, t3 screen shadow mask: engine). VS f32223e5 (#106102) = the verified V2 hair VS 36679c04 on TEXCOORD0 / TEXCOORD2 / SV_POSITION (vs_equiv_r6.json; its vertex height-fog block -> TEXCOORD7 is engine)",
 "kuro_root_material": "M_CharV2_Com",
 "blend_mode": "BLEND_Translucent",
 "two_sided": true,
 "outputs": {
  "Emissive": {
   "type": "float3",
   "kuro": "material Emissive Color (before the engine tail: max 0, emissive scale, OOB stripes, fog)"
  },
  "Opacity": {
   "type": "float",
   "kuro": "material Opacity (o0.a = Opacity * primitive fade after the tail)"
  },
  "OutBaseColor": {
   "type": "float3",
   "kuro": "desaturated toon lit colour (the albedo of the Kuro forward toon lighting)"
  },
  "OutNormal": {
   "type": "float3",
   "kuro": "world-space shading normal (Kuro: N . L of the local lights); not connected (UE Normal is tangent space)"
  },
  "OutShadowColor": {
   "type": "float3",
   "kuro": "shadow colour (deferred GBufferB.rgb before sqrt); Kuro toon-lighting input, not connected"
  },
  "OutShadow": {
   "type": "float",
   "kuro": "toon shadow term solid * smoothstep (A.z = AO * (S/2 + 1/2)); not connected"
  },
  "OutShadowAO": {
   "type": "float",
   "kuro": "shadow-factor AO (back-light solid lift, SolidShadowStrength); not connected"
  }
 },
