  "primitive": "Primitive data (ue_expr) or Kuro-only Primitive member (ue_expr null, explicit default)",
  "output": "out parameter, exposed as an additional Custom node output",
  "uniform_expression": "CPU uniform expression of material parameters `params` (`expr`, as UE material nodes in `ue_nodes`): evaluate on the CPU in float32 like a UE preshader, not in the Custom node"
